<title>FRANCE: Iran seeks 50,000 tns optional barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran seeks 50,000 tns optional barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran is in the market to import 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin barley for shipment in February, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>They said it launched the tender on Sunday.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
